 * Jai Ambey dealer app – LIVE STOCK (read-only)
 *
 * The app asks this web app which products are sold out. It answers ONLY
 * "sold out" / "available" per app product id – never quantities.
 * It only READS the IMS (scope: spreadsheets.readonly). It cannot change anything.
 *
 * Rule (Jayant, 24 Nov): stock 0 = Sold out. Stock above 0 = available.
 * Minus stock = available (an "In" entry is missing; the team confirms on WhatsApp).
 * Blank = not known: the app keeps its own list for that product.
 *
 * The IMS file id is NOT in this code: it is saved in Project Settings → Script properties
 * as IMS_ID (see SETUP-live-stock.md).
 */

